bum High/Low. In 2007, "Karmic" was reissued under the Hi-Speed Soul label with bonus track "Pressure Free".', 'Nada personal (album) | Nada Personal (Spanish for ""Nothing Personal"") is the second album recorded by Argentine rock band Soda Stereo, and released in 1985. It was recorded at Record Plant Studios in Los Angeles, California and remastered in 2007 at Sterling Sound Studios in New York.']
